  "contents": "\n\n<article>\n  <div class=\"github-links\">\n  <a href=\"https://github.com/ngrx/platform/edit/main/modules/signals/events/src/events-service.ts?message=docs(signals)%3A%20describe%20your%20change...#L33-L61\" aria-label=\"Suggest Edits\" title=\"Suggest Edits\"><i class=\"material-icons\" aria-hidden=\"true\" role=\"img\">mode_edit</i></a>\n  <a href=\"https://github.com/ngrx/platform/tree/20.1.0/modules/signals/events/src/events-service.ts#L33-L61\" aria-label=\"View Source\" title=\"View Source\"><i class=\"material-icons\" aria-hidden=\"true\" role=\"img\">code</i></a>\n</div>\n  <div class=\"breadcrumb\">\n    <script type=\"application/ld+json\">\n      {\n        \"@context\": \"http://schema.org\",\n        \"@type\": \"BreadcrumbList\",\n        \"itemListElement\": [\n          { \"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 1, \"item\": { \"@id\": \"https://ngrx.io//api\", \"name\": \"API\" } },\n          { \"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 2, \"item\": { \"@id\": \"https://ngrx.io/api/signals\", \"name\": \"@ngrx/signals\" } },\n          { \"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 3, \"item\": { \"@id\": \"https://ngrx.io/api/signals/events\", \"name\": \"@ngrx/signals/events\" } },\n          { \"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 4, \"item\": { \"@id\": \"https://ngrx.io/api/signals/events/Events\", \"name\": \"Events\" } }\n        ]\n      }\n    </script>\n      <a href=\"/api\">API</a> > <a href=\"api/signals\">@ngrx/signals</a> > <a href=\"api/signals/events\">@ngrx/signals/events</a>\n  </div>\n  \n  <header class=\"api-header\">\n    <h1 id=\"events\">Events<a title=\"Link to this heading\" class=\"header-link\" aria-hidden=\"true\" href=\"api/signals/events/Events#events\"><i class=\"material-icons\">link</i></a></h1>\n    <label class=\"api-type-label class\">class</label>\n    \n    \n    \n  </header>\n  \n  <aio-toc class=\"embedded\"></aio-toc>\n\n  <div class=\"api-body\">\n    \n  <section class=\"short-description\">\n    <p>Globally provided service for listening to dispatched events.</p>\n\n    \n  </section>\n  \n  \n  \n  <section class=\"class-overview\">\n<code-example language=\"ts\" hidecopy=\"true\" linenums=\"false\">\nclass <a href=\"api/signals/events/Events\" class=\"code-anchor\">Events</a> extends BaseEvents {\n}\n</code-example>\n\n  \n  \n\n</section>\n\n\n  \n\n  \n  \n  \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  \n<section class=\"usage-notes\">\n  <h2 id=\"usage-notes\">Usage notes<a title=\"Link to this heading\" class=\"header-link\" aria-hidden=\"true\" href=\"api/signals/events/Events#usage-notes\"><i class=\"material-icons\">link</i></a></h2>\n  <code-example language=\"ts\">\n<a href=\"api/store-devtools/DevToolsFeatureOptions#import\" class=\"code-anchor\">import</a> { <a href=\"api/signals/events/event\" class=\"code-anchor\">event</a>, <a href=\"api/signals/events/Events\" class=\"code-anchor\">Events</a> } from '@ngrx/signals/events';\n\nconst increment = <a href=\"api/signals/events/event\" class=\"code-anchor\">event</a>('[Counter Page] Increment');\n\n\\@Component({ \\/* ... *\\/ })\nclass Counter {\n  readonly #events = inject(<a href=\"api/signals/events/Events\" class=\"code-anchor\">Events</a>);\n\n  constructor() {\n    this.#events\n      .on(increment)\n      .pipe(takeUntilDestroyed())\n      .subscribe(() => \\/* handle increment <a href=\"api/signals/events/event\" class=\"code-anchor\">event</a> *\\/);\n  }\n}\n</code-example>\n\n</section>\n\n\n\n  </div>\n</article>\n\n<!-- links to this doc:\n - api/signals/events\n - api/signals/events/eventGroup\n - api/signals/events/withEffects\n - api/store/createActionGroup\n - guide/signals/signal-store/events\n-->\n<!-- links from this doc:\n - /api\n - api/signals\n - api/signals/events\n - api/signals/events/Events#events\n - api/signals/events/Events#usage-notes\n - api/signals/events/event\n - api/store-devtools/DevToolsFeatureOptions#import\n - https://github.com/ngrx/platform/edit/main/modules/signals/events/src/events-service.ts?message=docs(signals)%3A%20describe%20your%20change...#L33-L61\n - https://github.com/ngrx/platform/tree/20.1.0/modules/signals/events/src/events-service.ts#L33-L61\n-->"
